OL,3,GNEWSABroken hospital tap wastes a
OL,4,Amillion litres of water
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a million litres of water may
OL,7,Fhave been lost by a broken tap left
OL,8,Frunning at a hospital for almost three
OL,9,Fmonths.
OL,11,FBetsi Cadwaladr University Health Board
OL,12,Fsaid the tap, in Ysbyty Glan Clwyd's
OL,13,Femergency department, was fixed on
OL,14,FOctober 26 - but a sticker by it shows
OL,15,Fthe matter was reported on 7 August.
OL,17,FAccording to the Let's Save Water
OL,18,Fcampaign, funded by water companies, a
OL,19,Frunning tap wastes 10 litres a minute,
OL,20,Fwhich is 600 litres an hour or 14,400
OL,21,Flitres a day.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
