OL,3,GNEWSABroken hospital tap wastes a
OL,4,Amillion litres of water
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe health board said any decision to
OL,7,Fremove the facility from use had to be
OL,8,Fbalanced against potential impact on
OL,9,Fpatient care.
